<noinclude>[[category:Burgle Cats Skill Data Templates]]
==Documentation==
This template is used in the Burgle Cats namespace, along with a valid skill name listed in [[:category:Burgle Cats Skill Data Templates]], inside a span tag to show the information of a burgle ability.

===Syntax===
<code><nowiki><span class="burgle-ability-tooltip" data-skillname="{{1}}">{{2}}</span></nowiki></code>

Whereas:
*<nowiki>{{1}}</nowiki> is the skill name needed to show information of, all possible names are listed in [[:category:Burgle Cats Skill Data Templates]].
*<nowiki>{{2}}</nowiki> is the content that will be wrapped, when hover over will show a burgle skill's information template.
===Example===
Input: <nowiki><code><span class="burgle-ability-tooltip" data-skillname="Barefeet">Hover over this text.</span></code></nowiki>

Output: <span class="burgle-ability-tooltip" data-skillname="Barefeet">Hover over this text.</span>
</noinclude>